    <Variable Type="string" Name="CraftingRecipeDescription.Text" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:string">A bullet needs three parts: a projectile, a casing, and a propellant. Basics are on the train: the shop sells upgraded parts.

Combine a basic component with an upgrade of that type to create an upgraded component. To craft a finished bullet, place one of each of the three types (Casing, Projectile, Propellant) in their basic or upgraded form and hold to interact</Value>
